<p>This is just a Hanged King Tragedy reskin&#8230; until you find out the bands didn't actually die. Then it starts to get interesting.</p>
<p>But that new angle never actually goes anywhere. Like AlanDaris said, the incident log doesn't give us anything new, it just reinforces the &quot;ooo, spooky&quot; by adding children. I wanna know more about these bands that aren't actually the band. What are these people really eating? Is it something <em>even worse</em> than human meat? Explore the concept a little bit more in the article, and I'll be happy to give it an upvote. For now, -1.</p>

